{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05418","headline":"从军 · 刘庭琦","name":"从军","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朔风吹寒塞，胡沙千万里。\n阵云出岱山，孤月生海水。\n决胜方求敌，衔恩本轻死。\n萧萧牧马鸣，中夜拔劒起。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘庭琦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05418.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05418","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}